  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.33 Master plan",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.33 “Master plan” means a planning document developed in accordance with RSA 674:1 to RSA 674:4 that establishes the vision and land use and development principles for the municipality.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
